# SLICE-01c: ECS::StaticMeshComponent is REFLECTED like UE's UStaticMeshComponent (StaticMesh + OverrideMaterials):
# DesertCtl `set` reaches StaticMesh.MeshHandle and ONE element StaticMesh.MaterialSlots[0], each `assets:` path
# checked against the field's Asset<T> (ContentKindForAssetType), and the edit re-states its dependants
# (ECS::PostEditStaticMesh: a mesh clears the Primitive, the material instances rebuild from the slots).
# The cube (Primitive Cube, slot 0 = Starter_Prop) gets another mesh and another material, then a texture as its
# material (refused with the reason in editor.log), then the scene is saved and reopened.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,60,450
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.1,-1
Когда set 6018453462564557835 StaticMesh.MeshHandle assets:Meshes/Modeling/Blockout.stmesh
Когда set 6018453462564557835 StaticMesh.MaterialSlots[0] assets:Materials/CB_Red.demat
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 0_swapped the cube entity shows the Blockout mesh in the red CB material, not the grey Starter_Prop cube
Когда --expect-refusal set 6018453462564557835 StaticMesh.MaterialSlots[0] assets:Textures/T_Checker.detex
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 1_refused unchanged from 0_swapped; editor.log has "[Control] set ... refused: 'assets:Textures/T_Checker.detex' is a Texture, not a Material"
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,60,450
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.1,-1
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 2_reopen same as 0_swapped after the reopen (the saved mesh + material round-trip)
